Carafe: the compositor keeps the screen until a Vulkan swapchain; the logo screen until the loading screen.
A Vulkan surface reserves the screen instead of taking it: NVK gives the NWindow buffers only when a
swapchain is made, and DXVK makes it at its first present. wine_nx_vk_take_window hands it over then.
The compositor starts right after hold_thread_local_pages, and appletNotifyRunning is called wherever
something other than the loading screen is about to be seen. docs/research/loading-screen/REPORT.md.
LGPL-2.1-or-later, as the file it changes.

